        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s3ic",
          "text": "The lawsuit involves allegations that the dating companies continued to allow Stephen Matthews to use their platforms to assault women and continued to recommend Matthews as a “Most Compatible” match to unsuspecting women—even after one of Matthews’ first victims reported the assault directly to Hinge. See the ",
